                "shortText": "Lyon to Brook, OUT",
                "text": "<strong>bowled him! Extraordinary! Off the thigh pad!</strong> Shorter length, some extra spin and bounce, it hits the thigh pad as he shoulder's arms late, it bounces high up in the air, everyone lost sight of it, it came down and landed on the back of Brook's leg and bounced onto the stumps! Brook didn't think to look up and knock it away with his bat or body!"
